      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s phrase “other inner agencies” is not specifically supported by the packet, which distinguishes between (1) animation of all nature, (2) something dwelling in bodies but distinct from them, and (3) bodies inhabited by ghosts of departed men, without using the broader wording “inner agencies.”",
        "“Bodily life” is not an exact phrase in the packet; the packet instead refers to “something dwelling in bodies but distinct from them” (second usage) and “bodies … animated or inhabited” (third usage)."
